{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00973","headline":"横吹曲辞 折杨柳 · 韦承庆","name":"横吹曲辞 折杨柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里边城地，三春杨柳节。\n叶似镜中眉，花如关外雪。\n征人远乡思，倡妇高楼别。\n不忍掷年华，含情寄攀折。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦承庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}